          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuambira Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aambire Aiziraeli hivi: Mndiphoinjira tsi ambayo ninakuphani na kuvuna mavunoge, mundamrehera mlavyadzi-sadaka butsa ra kpwandza ra mavunogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andariunula mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu siku inayolungira Siku ya Kuoya ili mphahe kukubaliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo ndiphoriounula hiro butsa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu mundamlavira sadaka ya kuochwa ya turume ra mwaka mmwenga risirokala na chirema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phamwenga na sadaka hiyo, mundamlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu sadaka ya mtsere ya kilo mbiri za unga mnono uriotsanganywa na mafuha yenye kungu nono imuhamirayo, na sadakaye ya chinwadzi cha lita mwenga ya uchi wa zabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabila ya siku iyo ya kumrehera Mwenyezi Mlungu wenu sadaka hiyo, tamruhusiwa kurya mavuno ga matsere, gakale maphya, gakale gakukalangbwa au gakujitwa kukala mikahe. Hiri ni lagizo ra kare na kare kpwa vivyazi vyenu vyosi phatu phophosi mndiphosagala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
