              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 24:19–22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndiphovuna mavunogo mwako mundani, usivune tsetsetse hadi muphakani wala usiuye uchatsembwesa. Higo undagarichira achiya na ajeni. Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu.”",
          "type": "text",
